<headline>FINAL PRICING - McPherson County, Kan..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel, Nicolaus &amp; Co Inc said it received the written award for the $1.260 million of McPherson County, Kan. general obligation bonds, Series 1997 with a top yield of 4.30 percent in 2001.</p>
